# AUTOPATCH – AUTONOMOUS SOFTWARE BUG DETECTION AND REPAIR SYSTEM

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

I want you to develop a complete, professional, fully functional web application named:

**AutoPatch – Autonomous Software Bug Detection and Repair System**

AutoPatch is an intelligent software debugging and automated code repair platform designed for software developers who face problems such as logical errors, runtime crashes, incorrect outputs, security vulnerabilities, edge-case failures and unexpected software behavior.

The primary objective is to develop a real-world platform where developers can upload their software projects, analyze source code, identify bugs, understand their root causes, receive suggested code repairs, compare original and modified code, test the proposed fixes and approve changes.

This must be a real, working web application, not just a frontend prototype or static dashboard.

The application must provide an end-to-end debugging and repair workflow.

**Complete workflow:**

REGISTER → LOGIN → UPLOAD PROJECT → SCAN PROJECT → DETECT BUGS → ANALYZE ROOT CAUSE → GENERATE PATCH → COMPARE CODE → APPROVE PATCH → RUN TESTS → VALIDATE REPAIR → GENERATE REPORT.

