1. Retrieve the affected source file.
2. Identify the relevant code section.
3. Generate a proposed repair.
4. Validate the patch against the original file version.
5. Generate a unified code diff.
6. Save the original code.
7. Save the proposed code.
8. Save the explanation.
9. Mark the patch as Pending Approval.

The frontend must display the original and modified code side by side.

