Before applying a patch:
- Verify user ownership.
- Verify patch validity.
- Check the original file has not changed.
- Create an immutable backup or version.
- Record the operation in change history.

For GitHub repositories, apply approved changes to a separate repair branch. Never push directly to the default branch without explicit authorization.

